<Base>
<h1>Clessidra</h1>
<p class="lead">It's the instrument where you pour grains of sound from single drops into a dense cloud.</p>

<div class="prose">
  <p>A granular instrument inspired by the hourglass. It explores the slow emptying of the glass and the fast trickle of single grains. It lets you capture and bend time through sound, slowing it down, speeding it up, reversing it or freezing it. Broken grains, like sand, are gathered and pieced back together, never quite the same and never fully still.</p>
</div>

<dl class="panel meta">
  <dt>Status</dt><dd class="live">In progress</dd>
  <dt>Made at</dt><dd><a href="https://www.synthux.academy/residency">Synthux Design Residency 2026</a></dd>
  <dt>Hardware</dt><dd><a href="https://www.synthux.academy/">Synthux Simple Touch</a>, <a href="https://daisy.audio/">Electrosmith Daisy Seed</a></dd>
  <dt>Licence</dt><dd>MIT</dd>
</dl>

